## 🧪 Current Focus (v0 Scope)

- Screen analyzer pipeline
- OCR → semantic summarization
- App and context detection
- Stuck & error heuristics
- GenAI-driven decision logic
- End-to-end proactive demo

---

## 🛣️ Roadmap

### v0 — GenAI-First MVP (This Repo)
- Heuristic perception
- GenAI reasoning
- Proactive assistance validation
- Fast iteration & user feedback

### v1 — Hybrid Intelligence
- Replace heuristics with lightweight learned models
- Temporal modeling for attention patterns
- Personalized behavior embeddings
- Partial on-device inference

### v2 — Deep Learning & RL
- Attention-based sequence models
- Reinforcement learning for interruption timing
- Adaptive reward signals per user
- Reduced GenAI dependency

### v3 — Neuro-Symbolic Assistant
- Learned perception + symbolic reasoning
- Fully on-device intelligence
- Long-term cognitive modeling
- Assistive AI aligned with neurodiversity research

---

## 🌌 Long-Term Vision

> NEXUS is not a chatbot.  
> It is a **cognitive layer between the user and their digital world**.

The goal is not productivity at all costs —  
but **clarity, momentum, and self-trust** for neurodivergent minds.

---

## 📌 Status

**NEXUS v0 is an experimental MVP.**  
This repository focuses on validating *when* and *how* to help —  
before scaling *how intelligently* it learns.

